<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/OSDi#Disease> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Any type of disease or health condition that a person may suffer. Since diseases may have or not costs, utilities... all of these properties has been explicitly defined with cardinality 'min 0' as an hint for the ontology users" .
